#k:5101|5|Orientation_report|[ORIENTATION REPORT]@ @The Lazarus Gate Research (LGR) laboratory was founded as a subterrain facility in the city of Philadelphia,@Pennsylvania to pursue advanced scientific exploration beyond conventional limits and to this day remains committed to@reshaping the future of human existence. @All experiments here are dedicated to Project Lazarus. @The lab is divided into 9 levels: @ @Level 0-[Entrance], Level 1-[Control Room], Level 2-[Machinary Room], Level 3-[Gunsmith], @Level 4-[Research Room], Level 5-[Staff Rooms], Level 6-[Experimentation Room], @Level 7-[Archive], Level 8-[Alchemy Lab], Level 9-[Core] @ @[END OF REPORT]|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5102|5|Status_report|[STATUS REPORT]@ @Structural Damage:@67% damage to Research Wing Infrastructure.@48% collapse of access tunnels between Core Laboratory and Surface Exit.@Power failure in 4 of 7 auxiliary generators.@To move through the facility, laboratory personnel can open and close doors using the command "open/close {direction}"@for the door in that direction from current position.@Laser-Safety doors such as the one to the south from here can only be passed by human-identified users.@ @[END OF REPORT]|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5103|5|Safety_report|[AUTOMATED SAFETY REPORT - SYSTEM ID: CERBERUS V-12.4]@ @Status: RED LEVEL ALERT@Summary: 85% failure on security locks in containment cells. All lab exits blocked except for Level 9.@Location: Levels 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8@@Level 6: 91% of experimental subjects confirmed free-roaming.@Level 4: Total loss of command over containment systems; manual overrides nonfunctional.@Avoid Levels 4 and 6 if possible. If unavoidable, access Level 3 for extreme security measures: @Electromagnetic dischargers, and Class-6 fire suppression grenades.@ @[END OF REPORT]|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5104|5|Indications_to_exit|[INTERNAL SECURITY MEMORANDUM]@Issuer: PROMETHEUS CORE V-1.4@ @The LGR currently maintains an active catalog of 147 biological experimental subjects across Levels 4 through 8. The @majority of these entities are the result of classified research programs focusing on genetic manipulation, @regenerative augmentation, neural reconditioning, and anomalous lifeform synthesis. Due to the nature of their @enhancements and instability, several subjects have been classified under Hazard Category IV or higher, indicating @significant potential threat to personnel, infrastructure, and wider operational integrity if not properly contained. @ @In case of emergency weaponary is available on Level 3 and a emergency exit is located on Level 9.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5105|5|Entry_25|[LGR LOG - ENTRY 25]@ @Dr.Vexleigh: This Laboratory has already overcome all human kind knowledge about its own limintations. Projects such@as Project Mnemosyne and Core Regen have paved the way for breakthroughs yet unimaginable by the public world. And@still it shall never be seen by the world. Common humans can not even comprehend the consecuences of what will be@achieved here.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY25]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5201|5|Assistants_mannual|[INTERNAL OPERATIONS REPORT]@Issuer: PROMETHEUS CORE V-1.4 - Automated Systems Division@ @Subject: Operational Overview - Automated Assistant Units (A.A.U.) Deployment@ @Summary: In accordance with LCR's efficiency protocols and hazardous environment standards, multiple classes of @Automated Assistant Units (AAUs) have been fully deployed throughout the lab. Designed to supplement human personnel @across all operational sectors, AAUs enhance productivity, reinforce security measures, and ensure continuity of @mission-critical tasks in adverse conditions.@ @[End of Report - PROMETHEUS CORE Monitoring Active]|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5202|5|Model_info|[A.A.U. MODEL-S3C]@Issuer: CERBERUS V-12.4@ @Model: Securitron 3-C (S3C)@Task: Safety mantainance and containment of problematic experimentational subjects. Routine patrols of restricted@zones. Threat identification and lethal suppression protocols. Support of Containment Enforcement Teams during@specimen relocation.@ @Note: Model S3C is under containment while systems review unexpected violent behaviours towards exp subjects. @Current location: Machinary Room: East Saferoom. Only accesible with MR acces card.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5203|5|Instructions|[M.R. NAVEGATION INSTRUCTIONS]@Issuer: PROMETHEUS CORE V-1.4@ @Summary: In order to navegate through the Machinary Room it is neccessary to go through the Airlocks located between@differently pressurized areas of the room. Two members of the laboratory personnel are needed as one needs to open or@close the airlock from its respective terminal, all located outside, while the other one is inside.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5204|5|Manual|[AIRLOCKS USAGE INSTRUCTIONS]@In order to prevent accidents at the lab, only one gate of each arilock can be open simultaneously. When the@respective terminal is used, the doors will alternate allowing anyone in the airlock to pass to the other side.@To use a terminal type "use" or "u" followed by the name of the terminal, which will appear on the objects list on@the Description area (up-right).|0|-1|-1|0|                         |             ____        |   ,----"""""   .'       |  !  ___.""   __ \       |  !          _ _  \      |   \    __.' _ __  \     |    \    __.'       \    |     \    .--''   __ \_. |      \         ______.' |       '!.--""""         |
#k:5205|5|Lockdown_info|[M.R. LOCKDOWN INFORMATION]@Issuer: PROMETHEUS CORE V-1.4@ @Summary: Due to malfunction in containment systems through levels 3 to 9, access to level 3 has been locked down as@a security meassure. In case of necessity, access cards to both doors to the west from here are located at the north@of the west and the east wings of the Machinary Room respectively. To reach that location it will be needed to pass @through the airlocks. Check the Arilock's usage instructions to find more information.@|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5301|5|S1A_Model_Info|[A.A.U. MODEL-S1A]@Issuer: CERBERUS V-12.4@ @Model: Securitron 1-A (S1A)@Task: Routine patrols of restricted zones. Support of Containment Enforcement Teams during specimen relocation.@Note: Model S1A, while not a combat-designed droid, can be used under emergency situations for containment of @problematic experimentational subjects.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5302|5|C0P_Model_Info|[A.A.U. MODEL-C0P]@Issuer: CERBERUS V-12.4@ @Model: Control Droid 0-P (C0P)@Task: Report all kind of seccurity incidents or unusual behaviours of experimentational subjects.@Note: Model C0P, while not a combat-designed droid, can be used under emergency situations for containment of @problematic experimentational subjects.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5303|5|Manual:_Granades|[Gunsmith Inventory: Class-6 F.S. Grenade]@ @Subject: Class-6 Fire Suppression Grenade (FSG-6) - Usage information@Clearance Level: Restricted (Securitrons & Pyro-Chem Droids Only)@Purpose: Rapid containment of Class-6 fires (high-temperature, chemical-fed, or anomalous combustion).@Warning: Do not use near living tissue - cryogenic agent causes flash-freezing.@ @Usage: Typing "use" followed by the name of a trap will set that trap in your current location.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5304|5|Manual:_Discharges|[Gunsmith Inventory: Class-4 Electromagnetic Discharge Neutralizer]@ @Subject: Class-4 Electromagnetic Discharge Neutralizer (EDN-4) - Containment & Neutralization Protocol@Clearance Level: Restricted (Securitrons and Containment Teams Only)@Nature: Unstable high-energy plasma bursts (20,000-50,000 volts, 0.5-3 sec duration)@Used on containment tasks to reduce by force problematic subjects.@ @Usage: Typing "use" followed by the name of a trap will set that trap in your current location.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5401|5|Entry_26|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 26]@K: @I finally got to work directly with the specimens today. Vexleigh warned me they'd be aggressive, but@nothing could've prepared me. The small one - G-R314 - was different though. When I approached its containment cell,@it didn't snarl like the others. Just... stared. Like it was actually seeing me. During the neural stabilization@procedure, it thrashed at first, but then it stopped fighting. Looked right at me and made this... sound. Almost like@a word. I then injected Subject G-R314 with the stabilizer. It screamed. Not the usual animal noise-this was @different. Vexleigh says it's just neural feedback. That the serum "unlocks dormant pain receptors". But when it @collapsed afterward, shaking... Christ, I almost vomited. But I have to remember why I'm doing this. The black veins @up my arm aren't receding anymore.@ @Vexleigh's right: If the mutations progress, I'll end up like them.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5402|5|Entry_27|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 27]@Dr. Vexleigh: @The new aprentice is proving to be usefull. Maybe too curious however. But Project Lazarus wont take too long to be@finished. I need all the help i can get. Also that cop, Sg. Rourke, has been looking too close lately. I cant let@anyone get in the middle of this. Evelyn's eyes keep dissolving. I cant fail her. If this situation stays like this@i'll let Subject S-0001 handle it. Two hundred years of rage should make for an instructive display.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5403|5|Subject_Data_File|[EXPERIMENTAL SUBJECT: S-0001]@Subject ID: S-0001@ @Designation: "Elder Revenant" (Dragon-class morphology)@ @Current Status: ACTIVE - Hostile Potential Extremely High@Containment Cell: Sector 9-S (Extreme-security wing)@ @Current Location: Level 9 - CORE @ @Primary Instinct: Uncontrolled homicidal rage. Attacks all living things (including other subjects) @ @Hazard Level: RED|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5404|5|Subject_Data_File|[EXPERIMENTAL SUBJECT: G-R314]@Subject ID: G-R314@Mutation Stage: Type-G "Revenant" @Current Status: ACTIVE - Hostile Potential Low@Behavioral report: Recurring vocalization: "Gren...del...?" (Possible residual identity fragment). @Containment Cell: Sector 9-B (Low-security wing)@Current Location: [RESTRINGED_DATA]@Research Value: High (Potential for "reversion" testing)@ @WARNING: Mentioning "dad" or "baseball" near subject triggers aggression.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[%#9+%*#]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5501|5|1/4_Vexleigh's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY - 27/11/1813]@I have barely been able to continue my investigations. People have been coming night after night pounding upon my door@like the hounds of Hell themselves. Today one of them almost entered the house claiming he had lost his arm after a@week from my experiment about tissue regeneration. The fool could not comprehend the honour of participating in such@divine work! This situation is going out of control. I have tried to calm Evelyn as i could, but she is afraid.@However i can't leave my laboratory. My investigations are of much higher importance than the opinions of the idiotic@poblation of London, unable to understand the value of my research. |0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5502|5|2/4_Vexleigh's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY - 3/12/1813]@A larger mob has come upon us this night. They have forced entry into the house. Evelyn and I have taken refuge in the@vault below, though I fear it shall not remain hidden long. I can already hear the floorboards above groaning beneath@their weight. We must leave this place. There is no longer sanctuary here. We shall take the passage that runs beneath@the hill and leads to the other side of the mountain. England is no longer safe for us, perhaps not even Europe. Our@work has made us hunted.@ @They are here. We must go.|0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5503|5|3/4_Vexleigh's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY - 4/12/1813]@Evelyn was shot in the back during our escape. She grows weaker by the hour, though i am doing what i can without my@instruments. We have secured passage aboard a vessel bound for the eastern shores of America. Until we make land,@there is little more I can offer her beyond hope. Dear God... how has it come to this? Tomorrow morning, upon our@arrival, we shall board the very first train to Philadelphia.|0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5504|5|4/4_Vexleigh's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY - 5/12/1813]@Evelyn died this morning. It happend mere moments after we made land. If only i have had my instruments and my@laboratory... I could have saved her. No... I still can save her. I have to bring her back. All my investigations,@my knowledge, my years of study... all shall lead to a single, unwavering purpose: to restore her. To undo what fate@has so cruelly enacted. This will be the culmination of all of all my work.|0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5505|5|1/4_K's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY K. - 10/3/2023]@I have been doing my own research at home about hyper regeneration. My friends at college believe i wont get@anywhere but i sure will prove them wrong. All experiments on animals have been succesfull untill now. I think its@time to start some experiments on real people. But of course i havent been able to get anyone to do it. I'll have to@try this on myself. Tomorrow morning i'll try a small dosis and see the reaction on human tissue.|0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5506|5|2/4_K's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY K. - 11/3/2023]@The experiment didnt go as planed. I think I made a mistake. The compound wasn’t supposed to behave like this. It was@supposed to enhance cellular resilience, nothing more. A mild catalyst. Controlled. Predictable. Instead... I can't@even hold this pen properly anymore. About an hour after injection, I felt the first burning under my skin - then the@bone aches started. By the time I realized something was wrong, my right arm had already started changing. The skin@around my wrist has hardened into something grey and rough, and the muscle mass has expanded way beyond natural@proportions.|0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5507|5|3/4_K's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY K. - 13/3/2023]@The hospitals won’t understand. I’d be quarantined - or worse. I can’t go to the authorities. They wouldn't even@recognize me as human anymore if they saw this. There’s only one place left. That laboratory on the top of the@mountain. Its supposed to be closed and abandoned but ive seen light coming out of those doors at night and ive@heard stories of monsters being held there. Looking at my hand i think whoever is in charge there can understand this@kind of mistakes. If there's any chance left to fix this, it’s there.|0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5508|5|4/4_K's_Diary|[PERSONAL DIARY K. - 16/3/2023]@I finally found the lab. I entered and an old man recieved me. He already knew i was coming and he took me to a room@where he injected me some substance. My arm got much better immediatly. He told me his name is Dr. Vexleigh. He also@sayed i must stay here with him. Without that substance he injected me i would fully mutate into a monster. Vexleigh@will take care of me if i help him with his investigations. I am so lucky i ended up here... Apparently the substance@was gotten from one of the multiple subjects here in the lab. Its full of those creatures. Grotesc beings that try to@kill anything around them. I cant imagine what would have been of me if i had became one of them... |0|-1|-1|0|          _.-"\          |      _.-"     \         |   ,-"          \        |  ( \            \       |   \ \            \      |    \ \            \     |     \ \         _.-;    |      \ \    _.-"   :    |       \ \,-"    _.-"    |        \(___.--"        |
#k:5601|5|Local_News|LOCAL BOY MISSING AFTER WEEKEND HIKE @Blue Hollow, PA - Authorities are continuing the search for Grendel Brannon, age 8, who was reported missing late@Sunday afternoon after a day hiking with his father, James Brannon, in the remote forests near Hawk's Rest Mountain.@According to Mr. Brannon, the two had been walking a known trail when Grendel wandered briefly ahead and vanished@from sight. Despite immediate efforts to locate him and an overnight search conducted by local police and volunteers,@no trace of the boy has yet been found.@ @Local rumors have long surrounded abandoned structures and off-limits properties in the region, but authorities have @so far dismissed any connection to foul play. @"We're treating this as an active missing persons case," said Sargent Silas Rourke of the Blue Hollow Sheriff's @Department. "We urge anyone with information to come forward, no matter how small."@Grendel is described as 5'1", with dark brown hair and green eyes and was last seen wearing a grey jacket.@Mr. Brannon, who has been a single father ever since his wife passed away, has asked for privacy but encourages the@community to remain vigilant. Anyone with information is urged to contact the Blue Hollow Sheriff's Office.|0|-1|-1|0|                         |           ___.'!        |   ,----""" _]  !        |  (   [_.-'"  __ '.      |  (\    _.+#\  _  !      |   \\   \#.*'_ __  \     |    \\   __.'  ___  \    |     \\   .--''__.   \_. |      \\  .-""" ____/_.' |       '!.--""""         |
#k:5602|5|Entry_36|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 36]@K: @I've been in this laboratory for two years now. Today we had to do some experimentation on G-R314. It@had been a long time since the last time and when i entered its cell to take it, there was something about its eyes,@about its face... An image came to my mind in that instant and i remembered the face of a child disapeared years ago.@There was a foto of him in the newspaper. I swear he had the same look in his eyes. Maybe it was just the darkness in@the room but... I dont think i can tell Vexleigh about this.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY36]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5701|5|Infiltration|[01] INFILTRATION EVENT DETECTED THROUGH PRIMARY ENTRANCE GATE@Subject ID: Silas Rourke@ @Classification: Unauthorized Civil Authority (Badge ID: #7162-PD)@Method: Manual override of external gate security (clearance not granted)@Entry Time Logged: 03:46:10@ @[02] INFILTRATION EVENT DETECTED THROUGH NORTH VENTILATION SHAFT C12@Subject ID: James Brannon@ @Classification: Civilian - Unauthorized Entry@Method: Physical breach of outer grate (tool-assisted entry)@Entry Time Logged: 03:49:32@Ventilation sensors show trace biological disturbance and minor debris dislodgement|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[#%+##*+]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5702|5|Explotion_Cause|[LAB DAMAGE ORIGIN-TRACING]@Issuer: CERBERUS V-12.4@ @Summary: All damage was caused by an altercate on the Entry level simultaneously at the entrance door and the@ventilation room between the intruders and lab personnel.@ @Result: Internal explotion in lab systems and unknown gas leaked through ventilation.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[##%+#*+]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5703|5|Entry_37|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 37]@K: @THEY ARE ALL HUMAN. I found Vexleigh's schematics and anotations. All of them were abducted and transformed into@horror creatures for the sake of his obsession. Christ. What have i done? I've been pumping them full of agony for@the crazy goals of a man with a god complex. The bastard made sure I didn't ask questions. My "condition"? Probably@just another lie to keep me compliant. There must be a way to reverse this...|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY37]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5704|5|Entry_38|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 38]@K: @I found out about Project Lazarus. Vexleigh intends to take back his wife from the dead. That's what the machine on@Level 9 is for. This wont come for free however. I've done the calculations. The same gas he uses to convert people@into this monsters would bring her back but the amount of gas needed is uncontainable. Vexleigh pretends to just@flood the atmosphere with Conversion Gas. Philadelphia first. Then the state. Then... Humanity would be transformed.@I have to stop this. Even if it means burning the whole lab down. Even if it kills me. But he will always be ahead of@me... I must find a way...|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY38]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5705|5|G-R14's_Location|[G-R314 CONTAINMENT]@Issuer: PROMETHEUS CORE V-1.4@ @Summary: Due to high level research interest, subject G-R314 has been moved to Cell-6005 on level 6, which has been @locked for securing the subject.@ @Access Instructions: To enter cell 6005, a key is located at the storage on level 8.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY37]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5706|5|Entry_39|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 39]@K: @I only have one option. I've made a compound designed to errase the memories of a person. I'll put this on the@ventilation system and when Vexleigh cant remember anything i will take down this laboratory. I have to destroy the@Core of the lab. If my calculations are correct i'll be able to make a corrosive compund at the lab at level 8 if i@follow the instructions i left there. I should be able to find the necessary materials at the storage on the same@level. Then i'll pour it into the Core at Level 9. @ @I have also made a cure to my condition and stored it there too. I need to stay as strong as possible now.@Potentially it could also cure this creatures but there is no time for their salvation. I need to protect humanity@from the real monster that lays between this walls. @ @Out - Kyle Graye|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY39]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5707|5|Entry_40|[LCR LOG - ENTRY 40]@Dr. Vexleigh: The moment is upon me. Eve-9 synthesis is complete. All that remains is pouring the solution into the@Core. The Alchemy Room stores the last vials; I must retrieve them before that meddling policeman interferes. How@poetic that Silas Rourke, so obsessed with uncovering my work, will witness the triumph he sought to prevent. His@corpse will make excellent kindling for the reaction. Evelyn, my love - I have carved my soul into these walls and@rewritten the laws of death itself. Today, science will achieve what God denied us. Today, you will open your eyes. @ @- Dr. Alaric Vexleigh@[END OF LCR LOG]|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[ENTRY40]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
#k:5708|5|Instructions|[SCALE USAGE INSTRUCTIONS]@The Industrial scale is connected to the door system and will open it when activated.@ @Activation: To engage the mechanism it is needed a weight of about 660 pounds (about the weight of 4 people)|0|-1|-1|0|                         |             ____        |   ,----"""""   .'       |  !  ___.""   __ \       |  !          _ _  \      |   \    __.' _ __  \     |    \    __.'       \    |     \    .--''   __ \_. |      \         ______.' |       '!.--""""         |
#k:5709|5|Instructions|[GATE OPENING INSTRUCTIONS]@In order to open the door, all pressure plates in this room must be pressed.@ @Activation: To engage the mechanism it is needed about the weight of a person on each plate|0|-1|-1|0|                         |             ____        |   ,----"""""   .'       |  !  ___.""   __ \       |  !          _ _  \      |   \    __.' _ __  \     |    \    __.'       \    |     \    .--''   __ \_. |      \         ______.' |       '!.--""""         |
#k:5801|5|Instructions|[CORROSIVE ACID: PREPARATION]@Get from the storage:@- Vexite_Nitrate@- FerroSilicate_Gel@ @Then mix both at the alchemy stand (on the north-east corner of this lab) with command "use Alchemy_Stand" |0|-1|-1|0|                         |             ____        |   ,----"""""   .'       |  !  ___.""   __ \       |  !          _ _  \      |   \    __.' _ __  \     |    \    __.'       \    |     \    .--''   __ \_. |      \         ______.' |       '!.--""""         |
#k:5901|5|Instructions|[CORE POURING USAGE]@ @In order to pour any solution into the CORE system use command "drop". @In order for the CORE to execute Project Lazarus it will be needed a vial of Eve-9 and a fresh human corpse.@ @WARNING: Pouring a corrosive mix could cause fatal damage to the facility. Act with caution.|0|-1|-1|0| .---------------------. |!  __[##%+#*+]________  !|! !                 . ! !|! ! ----- -----     . ! !|! ! ---- -          . ! !|! !                 . ! !|! ! --- ---- ---    . ! !|! ! ---- --         . ! !|! !___________________! !|'._[]_[]______==+__(o)_.'|
